        {
          "text": "“Abisirayeli baze bacumbike bakikuje Ihema ry’Ibonaniro ariko bataryegereye cane, umuntu wese azobe musi y’ibendera ry’umuryango wiwe no musi y’ibendera ry’inzu yiwe.”",
